{"reviews":[{"id":"B08B1FF461-0","r":5.0,"t":"You should probably try yourself","x":"Well the reviews are mixed\u2026 so it\u2019s really hard to determine if you should get this wig or not. I say go for it because it\u2019s actually really nice and took the color easy. It doesn\u2019t shed, it\u2019s not thin, and it is true to length. As far as the thin reviews.. my wig was tightly curled (waves) and very sleek, and looked short in appearance. But when I WASHED IT\u2026 it was the complete opposite. It is 18 inches and it\u2019s not too thin and not overly thick it\u2019s actually perfect in density. I think some fo","h":56,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great Wig","x":"[[VIDEOID:a9820c9bff93b9087816f09eb8a8523b]] Bought this wig for my birthday and it came out great ! Used a little purple shampoo to tone it down but it took water color very well! Curled it and straightened multiple times. Great wig for the money !","h":53,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-2","r":1.0,"t":"The quality","x":"[[VIDEOID:def4f0b0cc23a2f00374442e5ddaf388]] I extremely dislike how I paid for 18 inches and got 14 inches. I\u2019m missing 4 inches off a wig I paid for. The hair is shedding already and I just picked up today. It very thin with thick knots in the lace. The hair feels dry and fake!! Why do these companies do that to hard working people? I paid my hard earned money just to be scammed!! I am not happy at all!!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-3","r":1.0,"t":"DO NOT WASTE YOUR COIN!","x":"[[VIDEOID:ca619d4ce7dbfea4daec62d03af4a6db]] If I could rate this with 0 stars I would. Before I even took it out the packaging I could tell it is not the 18 inches I paid for. Stretched out from the back of the wig it reaches about 12 inches so that\u2019s at least 6 inches I am missing. Secondly, it is definitely a synthetic wig which I did not want. The construction on the wig is bad, it\u2019s mad thin and this was falsely advertised. Don\u2019t buy this.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-4","r":1.0,"t":"I am highly up set","x":"I purchased this wig and it was supposed to be 18 inches it is only 14! The hair is soft but I missing 4 inches  !","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-5","r":4.0,"t":"Ok for the price","x":"So the wig came quickly actually before it was supposed to which was great it sheds a lot also whatever length you want or expect you are going to have to go up because the length is pure lies! This said 18\u201d it looks like 14 as you can see I did no trimming!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-6","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth the money","x":"Didn\u2019t look nothing how I see it on here. I ordered a 18 inch and got a 14 inch. The wig looks like a party wig and it tangles when washed. It\u2019s also thin and the tracks are showing. Very disappointed!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-7","r":1.0,"t":"Garbage","x":"I paid 90 dollars for the 18 inch wig and received a wig with length that barely went past my shoulders. The hair is thin and stringy and she'd as soon as I took it out of the bag. Do NOT buy","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-8","r":5.0,"t":"So many mixed reviews but I love this hair","x":"The hair is sooo soft it also doesn\u2019t have a weird smell like some other wigs and everything in the description is very true to the wig that I have receive \ud83d\ude01\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffe","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-9","r":5.0,"t":"Not true to length","x":"Very thin not true to length  its soft but I ordered 18 inch and the wig is 13 or 14 inches at best the knots are larger save your money not worth it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-10","r":5.0,"t":"Customer service was outstanding.  Will order from this vendor again.","x":"I will order from this vendor again.  The customer service was great.  The hair is soft, doesn't shed,  and doesn't come with a horrible smell.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-11","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!!","x":"takes color very well, feels soft, good quality, lace is transparent and its a very good starter wig for coloring/installing!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-12","r":5.0,"t":"Quality of hair","x":"I love the hair quality and softness I would definitely buy wigs in the future again everything was on point so awesome","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-13","r":1.0,"t":"Do not buy","x":"I ordered an 18in and this is definitely 14in. I\u2019m so pissed. It\u2019s super thin and not worth the money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-14","r":5.0,"t":"Buy this now","x":"[[VIDEOID:99ea62fa92310e3989567b8153c6d083]] This is a beautiful wig ! Perfect color and size and full","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-15","r":3.0,"t":"\ud83d\ude11","x":"It was cool for what I needed it for\u2026 took it right off after my photoshoot.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-16","r":1.0,"t":"It\u2019s a blonde wig but it\u2019s so thin","x":"Hair is very thin , this isn\u2019t something you would just wanna buy.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-17","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing","x":"This was amazing hair, I haven\u2019t worn it yet but it\u2019s GREATTTT","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-18","r":5.0,"t":"So customizable!","x":"[[VIDEOID:735c39252b8796ce692e3c4672a20e7f]] I really liked how you can customize the color of it. It is true to length. Next time I think I would order a longer one. (Personal preference) it came in a cute golden honey blonde and I was able to tone it to an ashy blonde and it turned out perfect. Lace was decent especially if you know how to lay it. Honestly will buy again so I can experiment with more colors! Hair is super soft and reacted well with heat! I get tons of compliments on it!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-19","r":3.0,"t":"Cheaper is always better!!!","x":"The hair wasn't bad for its price. I bought it due to a water color project I had to do. Takes color well. My only concern was the hair had a terrible odor to it, thin in density, and wasn't true to length. If the company can do something about that, everything else will be fine. Folks are giving their hard earned dollars and to be taken advantage of like this is bad business.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-20","r":5.0,"t":"Come just like pic described","x":"[[VIDEOID:73e7d754043bda26ace32db8803eba9]] This hair came exactly how they described. I was satisfied with the length and the lace was perfect. I also colors the hair and it didn't lose the soft texture. I will definitely use the hair again. I believe after I pluck it and bleach the knots the wig will be gorgeous.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-21","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing Wig! Worth every penny!","x":"I bought this wig to dye for a photoshoot. The hair was soft, perfectly packaged and worth every penny. I was very pleased with the quality of how the wefts were sewed and I got such an even color on this wig! I can\u2019t wait to cut, style and install this!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-22","r":5.0,"t":"Love this wig!","x":"Real soft and minimal shedding. The lace is perfect and will blend with any skin tone. It definitely needed toning and that\u2019s what I did to it. I actually only used purple shampoo because I want to have some fun with it via adding some color.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-23","r":5.0,"t":"Love this Blonde on me!!!!","x":"Loved this wig! The price was perfect. The hair was so soft and easy to style and maintain. The fits my skin tone perfectly. I got so many looks and compliments. I will definitely purchase another wig and hair from this company.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08B1FF461-24","r":5.0,"t":"613 18\u201d wig","x":"[[VIDEOID:303ff803aa81ac2db3684fdbc5bfa306]] Now this wig I was scared to buy but when it came it was so pretty blonde I didn\u2019t want to dye it. The hair is exactly as displayed and it took the color amazingly","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report the wig is not true to length, often receiving around 14 inches instead of the ordered 18 inches.","cites":[3,4,5,6,7,8,10,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the hair as thin, with some also noting shedding.","cites":[3,6,7,8,10,14]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers praise the hair as soft and of good quality.","cites":[9,11,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the wig takes color well.","cites":[1,2,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the wig does not shed and has no bad smell.","cites":[1,9,11]}]},"qa":[]}